@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000

### 1. Creación exitosa (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-001

{"customerName":"Ana López","items":[{"productId":"P-100","quantity":2,"unitPrice":25.5}]}

### 2. Misma clave + mismos datos: mismo ID, sin duplicar (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-001

{"customerName":"Ana López","items":[{"productId":"P-100","quantity":2,"unitPrice":25.5}]}

### 3. Misma clave + datos diferentes: conflicto (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-001

{"customerName":"Carlos Pérez","items":[{"productId":"P-100","quantity":1,"unitPrice":25.5}]}

### 4. Clave diferente: intento diferente (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-002

{"customerName":"Ana López","items":[{"productId":"P-100","quantity":2,"unitPrice":25.5}]}

### 5. Error de validación (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-invalid-001

{"customerName":"A","items":[]}

### 6. Listado: dos filtros, ordenamiento y paginación
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?status=pending&customerName=ana&sort=total&order=desc&page=1&pageSize=1

### Sustituir UUID para consultar, modificar y cancelar
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"confirmed"}

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/orders/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
